aspect of the areola  which extends to 6 0cm of the posterior margin  and 2 0cm of the anterior margin  No clip is identified  The surrounding  tissue is white yellow and fibrofatty  Specimen also contains a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x  0 9cm ill defined  tan pink to yellow  indurated mass in the central outer  breast  which extends to 7 0cm of the posterior margin and abuts the anterior  margin  and is 3 0cm lateral to mass  1  The mass contains a clip  The  specimen also contains a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm dumb bell shaped  indurated mass  within the upper outer quadrant  which extends to 4 5cm of the posterior  margin and 3 0cm of the anterior margin  and is 4 0cm lateral to mass  1   Three possible lymph nodes are identified in the lateral tissue  Also received  within the container is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm aggregate of unremarkable pieces  of fibroadipose tissue  The following representative sections are submitted      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  1 entirely submitted    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of fibroadipose tissue between mass  1 and mass  2      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  2 entirely submitted with the section containing the clip in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   and a representative nearest posterior margin in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of fibroadipose tissue between mass  2 and mass  3    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  3 entirely submitted    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of fibroadipose tissue away from all masses      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   3 possible lymph nodes    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of separately received piece of fibroadipose  tissue       Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M D   Electronically signed on Thursday  REMOVED_MONTH 23   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 04 36 06PM  By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final  Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed  or c