gin is inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned from superior to inferior and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   with the superior end en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   and the inferior end en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  re excision inferior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm portion of tan pink fibrofatty tissue with a short black stitch designating the new  inferior  margin  and a long black stitch designating the  lateral  margin  The superior aspect of the specimen displays a REMOVED_DATE x 1 7cm exposed hemorrhagic gray white cavity  The new inferior margin is inked black  the anterior margin is inked green  and the posterior margin is inked yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned from medial to lateral and entirely submitted sequentially as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   with the medial margin en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   and the lateral margin en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  re excision superior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm portion of tan pink fibrofatty tissue with a short black stitch designating the  superior  margin  and a long black stitch designating the  lateral  margin  There is an exposed REMOVED_DATE x 2 8cm cavity along the anterior aspect  The posterior margin is inked black  the anterior margin surrounding the cavity is inked blue  the superior margin is inked green  and the inferior margin is inked yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned from medial to lateral to reveal focally dense gray white fibrous tissue with regions of yellow orange discoloration  The specimen is entirely submitted from medial to lateral as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   with the medial margin en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   and the lateral margin en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  final margin superior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm aggregate of gray white to tan pink fibrofatty tissue with no orientation  Sectioning reveals focally dense