le lymph nodes   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional representative sections of fibroadipose tissue  Received fresh are 5 containers which are  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  Labeled  right breast anterior final margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm fragment of fibroadipose tissue with a stitch marking the new margin  The stitched surface is inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Labeled  right breast superior final margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm fragment of fibroadipose tissue with a stitch marking the new margin  The surface with the stitch is inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Labeled  right breast inferior final margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm fragment of fibroadipose tissue with a stitch marking the new margin  The surface with the stitch is inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID        Labeled  right breast medial final margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm fragment of fibroadipose tissue with a stitch marking the new margin  The new margin is inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Labeled  right breast posterior final margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm fragment of fibroadipose tissue with a stitch marking the new margin  The new margin is inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION   1  RIGHT AXILLARY LYMPH NODE  METASTATIC CARCINOMA  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1A  RIGHT AXILLARY LYMPH NODE  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE ADDENDUM NOTE  REASON  1 QUANTITATIVE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR RECEPTOR PROTEINS Breast  Right  block  REMOV