ive sections are submitted as follows  A  indurated areas of posterior margin  B  indurated area to skin ellipse and anterior superior and inferior margins  C  indurated area to posterior and inferior margins  D  indurated area to the medial deep inferior margin  E  representative away from biopsy cavity to include lateral margin  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  sentinel node left  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm tan yellow  focally bright blue lobular aggregate of fat containing a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm blue rubbery lymph node which is submitted in toto in cassette F  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  final shaved margins  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm blue tinged fibrofatty aggregate which is submitted in toto in cassettes G J  Gross Description by  KRISTEN SMITH Resident  KRISTINA M  BRAATEN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   REEXCISION PART B  LYMPH NODE  LEFT SENTINEL  PART C  BREAST  LEFT FINAL SHAVED MARGINS    report_end  , Unchecked.
